Wait a subtle one: `.soul-row .in-view` transition in .js-fx section does not include .soul-row base transitions... `.js-fx .soul-row.in-view { transition: opacity... transform... border-color... }` — hmm my js-fx block lists only `.card.in-view` transitions — let me re-check what I wrote: 

```
.js-fx .card.in-view, .js-fx .soul-row.in-view, .js-fx .stat-card.in-view {
