.soul-row base has its own transition incl translateX hover — overridden by .in-view list (same specificity .js-fx .soul-row.in-view = 0-3-0 vs .js-fx .card 0-2-0... hover translateX transition uses .in-view list → transform included dur-3 with --st delay (cleaned after reveal) ✓ border-color included ✓ opacity ✓. OK good enough — hover translateX works with dur-3 (600ms — a bit slow but fine, "silk").

Also stat-card hover border/transform: .stat-card transition own rule — but .in-view overrides transition list (border-color dur-1 + transform dur-3 ✓ box-shadow... stat-card has no box-shadow transition — harmless.

Also JS syntax check + quick browser smoke. Run node --check on app.js.

