        img.src = out.toDataURL("image/png");  // wait — img.onload handler attached inline will... setting src re-fires load → heroFit called again? Inline onload="heroFit(this)" — re-setting src fires onload → recursion → dataset.trimmed="1" guard prevents second trim; then normal fit runs. good.
        return;
