Wait — after replacing src, when new image loads, onload fires heroFit again: trimmed=1 so skips trim, fits cropped W/H into max box → perfect: visible portion now fills 380px height.

Edge: toDataURL big images (1160×1160 → crop maybe 700×700) fine locally.

