Apply data-hero-trim only in the test override: heroBox emits trim attr when entry has `[w,h,trim]`? Extend arrays: 608: [470, 380, "trim"], soul1: [470, 380, "trim"]. heroBox: data-hero-trim="1" if t?.[2].

